  cluster mean inside R500                   rho=3.107e-24 kg/m^3  lambda_J=1.4291e+11 m = 4.631e-09 kpc
  MW halo mean inside 20 kpc                 rho=2.020e-22 kg/m^3  lambda_J=5.0327e+10 m = 1.631e-09 kpc
